x8fDE3OTUxNDE3NzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Annie Spratt on Unsplash", "author": "Annie Spratt", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@anniespratt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-k35mDhjCJ0c?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(143, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(181, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "81ef2143d31f"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-20", "word_count": 128, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "AIを作る会社Anthropicがナスダックに上場しました。とても大きな上場でしたが、同じ日に多くの研究者が反対の手紙を出しました。", "lead_zh": "做AI的公司Anthropic在纳斯达克上市了。这是一次规模很大的上市，但就在同一天，很多研究者发表了反对公开信。", "preview": "AnthropicはClaudeというAIを作る会社です。株の値段は1株83ドルで、集めたお金は約8134億ドルでした。これは今までで一番大きな新規上場です。NVIDIAやMicrosoftなど7社も、さらに260億ドル分を買うと約束しました。", "preview_zh": "Anthropic是一家做Claude这款AI的公司。股价为每股83美元，募集资金约8134亿美元，是史上最大的新股上市。NVIDIA和Microsoft等7家公司还承诺再购买260亿美元的股票。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1010, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 12.225, "size_bytes": 198000, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 63, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@3fb0b9b3/content/data/versions/1027.json"}], "ja_n3": [{"content_hash": "fc429539d93e7f04", "version_id": 1028, "article_id": 103, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "Anthropicがナスダック上場、史上最大のIPOに研究者たちが反発", "title_zh": "Anthropic登陆纳斯达克，史上最大IPO却引来研究者集体反对", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1690375?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620302044902-30315ad936cb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YW50aHJvcGljJTIwaXBvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUxNDE3NzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=ma